		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="16008"></a><b>Parnhamien</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Old Fart<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/3sword.gif" alt="Journeyman" title="Journeyman" border="0" /><br /><img src="images/avatars/13106141203f30ffdb6b6db.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Joined: 31 Oct 2002<br />Posts: 228<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=16008&amp;sid=fd9907a37ca4d4b723af5b1ac0135a72#16008"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Oct 31, 2002 6:37 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=16008&amp;sid=fd9907a37ca4d4b723af5b1ac0135a72"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">His armour is no longer black. It is instead a missed matched collection of gold, white, green and brown. His demeanor as he walks into the Kindred Spirits has also changed dramatically since he was last here. So it is that he goes unrecognized as he approaches the bar. 'Good day Indalis!' he says. 'I'll have a double of out of my stock and bowl of stew, Lamaridine's in fact if she has happen to make any recently. If not yours will do!' The Paladin grins broadly as he takes of his helm.  What I fine day to be home again at long last! 
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Indalis gapes in shock. 'Parnhamien? Is that you Lad?'
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
'None other my friend, none other' Parnhamien continues to smile at the bemused barkeep.... 
<br />
<i></i><br />_________________<br />Parnhamien Tor'Dainal
<br />
Paladin of Marr
<br />
Elder Concordat Angelis</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
