		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row2"><span class="name"><a name="16009"></a><b>Nabastin Earthguard</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Guest<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=16009&amp;sid=fd9907a37ca4d4b723af5b1ac0135a72#16009"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Oct 31, 2002 7:13 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=16009&amp;sid=fd9907a37ca4d4b723af5b1ac0135a72"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Glances over at Parnhamien and admires his multicolored assortment of armor. "Greetings great one" says Nabastin "I am Nabastin, gnomish paladin of Brell. If you ever need a kind ear to speak to or just wish kind friendship, you have but to ask. and may i say, Welcome home."
<br />

<br />
 
<br />
Nabastin
<br />

<br />
Loyal Paladin of Brell Serilis
<br />

<br />
Tyro of Concordat Angelis
<br />

<br />
Druzzil Ro Server of Everquest
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Brell Serilis has given me the duty and power to protect the earth. The earth shall protect me in return.&quot;<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
