				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Lanturias looks up from the bar,  where he is scribbling out a note...any who look close could make out the words &quot;spectres&quot; and &quot;danger&quot; on it. He flashes Parnhamien a grin while listening to him greet the new paladin and states &quot;Looking good, Parn.&quot; 
<br />
